<title>USA: Pharmhouse settles Woolworth unit suit.</title>
<headline>Pharmhouse settles Woolworth unit suit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmhouse Corp said on Monday it settled a lawsuit it brought against a unit of Woolworth Corp over Pharmhouse's 1995 purchase of Rx Place stores.</p>
<p>Woolworth agreed to forgive certain debt and accommodate Pharmhouse regarding certain stores, the company said.</p>
